  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "opening",
      "text": "These questions are about the trial \"Image Guided VATS vs. VATS Resection\". Your earlier answers already covered 2 of its rules. I'll ask about the rest of its rules one at a time. You can skip any question, and \"I don't know\" is always fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "question",
      "text": "Thanks. To confirm, are you 18 years of age or older?",
      "criterionId": "P1"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "participant",
      "kind": "reply",
      "text": "Yes, I'm 77, so I'm definitely old enough."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "question",
      "text": "Has your thoracic surgeon said you are a candidate for iVATS surgery? (iVATS is a type of minimally invasive lung surgery using image guidance.)",
      "criterionId": "P2"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "participant",
      "kind": "reply",
      "text": "I'm not sure if my surgeon has said that yet. I'm just trying to understand my options right now."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "question",
      "text": "Thanks. Have you been told where your lung lesions are located? Specifically, are they in the outer half of the lung or lobe?",
      "criterionId": "P4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "participant",
      "kind": "reply",
      "text": "I'm not sure about the exact location. I know it's in my lungs, but I don't remember if they said which part or lobe."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "question",
      "text": "Are you currently being evaluated at the Thoracic Surgery outpatient clinics at BWH or DFCI?",
      "criterionId": "P5"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "participant",
      "kind": "reply",
      "text": "I'm not sure if that's where I'm being evaluated. I've been seeing my oncologist, but I don't know about those specific clinics."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "question",
      "text": "To clarify, have you had any appointments specifically with the Thoracic Surgery team at Brigham and Women's Hospital (BWH) or Dana-Farber Cancer Institute (DFCI)?",
      "criterionId": "P5"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "participant",
      "kind": "reply",
      "text": "I don't know about those specific clinics. I've just been seeing my regular oncologist."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "kind": "closing",
      "text": "Thank you, that's all my questions. Your record for this trial is ready, for you and your oncologist. They and the trial team decide whether it is right for you."
    }
  ],
